      "product_summary": "Wide toe-box lace-up mesh walking shoes for summer casual assortments. The curved white side detail and raised contrast sole band create a recognizable two-tone profile. A low-cut upper and traditional laces let buyers offer a familiar sneaker shape with a wider toe design.\nBlack, White; EU 36-48 provide color and size choices for wholesale assortments.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Share footwear specifications, quantities, packaging needs and destination for review and quotation. Company images introduce company activities and order coordination."
